  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Greetng By Billy**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances [2]\n- **Lonesome Rver**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Knights In White Satin**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Big Spike Hammer**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Sugar Hill Ramble**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Hide N Seek**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Hide N Seek**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Billy Banter And Introdctions**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2025-04-04** (recommended): source not stated; 26 songs; 150 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: St. Augustine [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2025-04-04**: taped by Z-Man; transferred by Z-Man; source: Schoeps CCM4V'S>Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II (48/32) [1]. Also: Taped by Z-Man from Section 102, Row A, seat 117, with the mics held 6.5 feet high; Micah Ennis assisted; Processed through Sound Forge 10.0 and CD Wave, converted to 16-bit FLAC, and tagged in Foobar 2000; labeled show number 80 of 2025 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings St. Augustine Amphitheatre - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/the-st-augustine-amphitheatre/) [3]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings St. Augustine N2 - Regular Poster - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/st-augustine-n2-regular-poster/) [4]\n- Poster by panetory.com: [Billy Strings Apr 4 2025 The St. Augustine Amphitheatre Poster 2026](https://panetory.com/billy-strings-apr-4-2025-the-st-augustine-amphitheatre-poster) [5]",
